{"completed": true, "response": "{\"better\":\"Y\",\"regress\":\"有，Y个别感受句把音乐比喻得过于具体，替观众规定画面的程度比X稍高，留白少一点。\",\"nets\":{\"scan\":\"Y\",\"point\":\"Y\",\"why\":\"Y\",\"whole\":\"Y\",\"fine\":\"Y\"},\"why\":\"Y把每一步心理变化拆成短句，并用放大的关键词先给眼睛落点，感受又按音乐时点出现，所以即使边听边扫，也更容易抓住“发生了什么—为什么会这样—接着怎么变”。X的主线其实写得清楚，但不少屏幕右侧同时堆了太多并列感受，尤其短停留段里很难判断哪些最重要；Y把这些感受落到呼吸、脚步、失重、回声等具体瞬间，前面反复出现的“受委屈—亲近—孤单—要不要回去—带着想念往前走”也更容易被认成同一条心理线。\"}", "metadata": {"session_handle": "b5957253-76b5-477d-8cde-78427d4f60f4", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T032828096818Z", "elapsed_seconds": 10.047, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T03:28:38.161181+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "fb08f5290eeaf3b04ddc4f054cc52f02fc70825a36c39fe626df6f6e4152cc20", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156d